    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23af76dc5fa6645fee1fb534",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "老爸就爱骑摩托车。虽说他不是个赛车手啦，\n但他总是载着我，开着摩托车到处跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "190c4810bbd7255e131d2b447e68aa88c3d7204293bbeb416888723e515edd5a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1008/storytimeline_041008006.json",
      "json_path": [
