    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d903d173c02ed260cdf3e0af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且，他还经常说，『让自己永远活在极限中』\n『让眼泪随疾风飞去』之类的。老爸总是像这样耍帅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fe150f971d596fd7b2b91ed947d1aa4e4af8562eaca6894b3a71ec2b96f550a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1008/storytimeline_041008006.json",
      "json_path": [
