    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e075551c82b5b5a30cf39f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使用自己的双脚跑，也能跟摩托车一样快！\n不论在马路上还是越野都行。毕竟她也是个马娘嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fb328bc1a024cd476c37bf6c9cea9f138b71fcb514029a2196cf7017a3610b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1008/storytimeline_041008006.json",
      "json_path": [
