    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89ce4baf525708029fd4abd5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个，我的生存方式，是错了吗？\n『以帅气为第一目标』什么的，很奇怪吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bdb2ecc9d330f67eacff5205a2b21739d697f9dd24af5269d3565df6bb977df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
