    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9368687007f29670279b5956",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这条路，我以前经常坐着老爸的摩托车在上面跑。\n目的地是工作的工厂，还有平民区的定食屋之类的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a093105ac1265c29e7c0eafe2bbe577752e2ce98aa356a10bd9202480a66b12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
