      "uid": "zhcn:f0612b908868884ccc904302",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说并不是带着我去玩的。\n但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d98ec629763e65ad46f31e3ccbd2ebfa9a8c54931571affafcbf0e74b1bc7a86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
